description: Per-branch AI prompt logs must be committed with every pull request
alwaysApply: true
---

# AI logs

Cursor hooks write prompts and results to `ai-logs/<branch>.md` (slashes in the branch name become `--`).

- Use a personal branch name such as `yourname/short-task` so the log identifies who typed the prompts.
- Do not delete or rewrite other people's log files.
- Include your branch log in the pull request. CI fails if it is missing.
